{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42366","headline":"右省仆射相公垂览和诗复贻长句輙次来韵 · 徐铉","name":"右省仆射相公垂览和诗复贻长句輙次来韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西院春归道思深，披衣闲听暝猨吟。\n铺陈政事留黄阁，偃息神机在素琴。\n玉柄暂时疎末座，瑶华频复惠清音。\n开晴便作东山约，共赏烟霞放旷心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42366.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42366","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}